><button class=\"language-chip\" data-lang-chip=\"en\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">EN</button><button class=\"language-chip\" data-lang-chip=\"ja\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">日本語</button><button class=\"language-chip active\" data-lang-chip=\"zh-CN\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">简体中文</button><button class=\"language-chip\" data-lang-chip=\"zh\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">繁中</button><button class=\"language-chip\" data-lang-chip=\"th\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">ไทย</button></div>\n<a class=\"pill-button\" href=\"../pages/get-in-touch.html\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_30043e863774f58fe55cee51\">联系我们</a>\n</aside>\n\n<div class=\"search-modal\" id=\"searchModal\" aria-label=\"搜索\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\n<div class=\"search-card\">\n<div class=\"search-head\">\n<h2 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_6d8052f4f2c70be5eea2174d\">搜索</h2>\n<button class=\"circle-button\" id=\"searchClose\" type=\"button\" title=\"关闭搜索\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\"><svg class=\"icon-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12\"></path><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button>\n</div>\n<input class=\"search-input\" id=\"searchInput\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索页面、产品和解决方案\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n<div class=\"search-results\" id=\"searchResults\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"sp-main ci-main\" data-home-detail=\"\" data-preserve-case=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"--detail-header-space: 112px;\">\n<section class=\"ci-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"ci-title\">\n <img class=\"ci-hero-background\" src=\"../assets/images/contact/background-scent-20260919.webp\" width=\"1045\" height=\"484\" alt=\"Background Scent 的玻璃入口，映照着蓝色与琥珀色灯光。\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"eager\">\n <div class=\"ci-container ci-hero-grid\">\n <div class=\"ci-hero-copy\"><h1 id=\"ci-title\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_3a59af04274c6a84df760b47\">联系我们</h1><h2 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_b540ff3bf8ab2da14e061601\">携手创造未来。</h2>\n <p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_670540897efcb6749d5ae66a\">无论您正在开发新产品、探索新市场、改善感官表现，还是寻找战略创新伙伴，我们的跨学科团队都愿与您携手合作。</p>\n <p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_92a23a82f48a6f7f8d0be17c\">从洞察与概念开发，到配方、感官策略及实施，我们帮助将想法转化为有意义的解决方案。</p>\n <ul class=\"ci-cities\" aria-label=\"我们的全球办公地点\"><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_a71021729c8ed76af030b0b1\">台北</li><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_4fa67d8c961eb1c3f15de17d\">曼谷</li><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_b0ae1c47787ac4b7ea93e435\">东京</li><li data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_05015a292f7c656556644a34\">洛杉矶</li></ul></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"ci-contact-section\"><div class=\"ci-container ci-contact-grid\">\n <aside aria-labelledby=\"ci-help-title\"><h2 id=\"ci-help-title\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_cd5d6c7586eb7650067be1ff\">我们可以如何协助？</h2><div class=\"ci-services\">\n <article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-lightbulb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_87287fbacdcad2edc5d6c29c\">启动新项目</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_2f6d074f2046fdc949af4327\">与我们分享您的想法、挑战或机遇。我们可以帮助将其形成清晰的概念与可执行的开发方向。</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-chart-line-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_615cbb4bf35117eeea6b5f8f\">开发或改进产品</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_9009774a02a0766ed2069769\">与我们在风味、香氛、食品原料、功能性解决方案、护肤及感官科学领域的专家合作。</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-head-circuit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_5c0d732858cd702440d0c7ce\">感官策略与咨询</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_f1ac2e7de9cbd4c3a9dffe6e\">通过以证据为基础的感官策略，打造更有力的产品、品牌及人类体验。</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-magnifying-glass\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_9279d74b20d104d8b7b0a60a\">寻找解决方案</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_6ce5ffb4a5978fc5df8de394\">正在寻找特定原料、技术、风味、香氛或功能性解决方案？我们的团队可以协助确定合适的方法。</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-users-three\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_489c898df723784cc851ca16\">共创与创新</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_c08598d302df44b871b00ec0\">从早期创意构思到开发与实施，与我们的跨学科团队合作。</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"ci-service\"><i class=\"ph ph-handshake\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div><h3 data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_d74a339671079044575770e3\">业务与战略合作</h3><p data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_4caab4cdcec8941fb2e0fcbe\">欢迎联系我们，探讨技术合作、市场开发、分销及长期战略伙伴关系。</p></div></article>\n </div></aside>\n <div class=\"ci-form-panel\"><h2 id=\"ci-form-title\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_83487a10a309ccc0386d92af\">告诉我们您正在开展什么项目。</h2><p class=\"ci-form-intro\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_161b95f5f590623a80c5b30b\">填写表单，我们的团队会与您联系。</p>\n <form id=\"ci-form\" aria-labelledby=\"ci-form-title\" method=\"post\" action=\"../api/contact/inquiries\">\n <p class=\"ci-sr-only\" data-preserve-case=\"true\" data-arotec-i18n-bound=\"u_8f697fa2c967ad9f207ff527\">标有 <span class=\"ci-required\" data-arotec-i18n-slot=\"u_8f697fa2c967ad9f207ff527:0\">*</span> 的字段为必填项。</p>\n <div class=\"ci-fields\">\n  <label data-preserve-case=\"true\">名 <span class=\"ci-required\">*</span><input name=\"first_name\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" placeholder=\"名\" maxlength=\"100\" required=\"\"></label>\n  <label data-preserve-cas